BP("Data Handling and Sovereignty: The inference server stores only cryptographic SHA-256 policy hashes and structured audit JSON, guaranteeing zero persistence of raw crawled document text. Audit caches keyed by domain hash rather than user identity ensure zero user tracking.")
BP("Transparency and Auditability: Every finding surfaces with verbatim evidence quote, statutory citation, and legal reasoning trace. Compliance officers maintain full governance to inspect and adjudicate reasoning traces. Audit artifacts are cryptographically bound to the policy version hash, allowing fiduciaries to verify the exact document audited.")
BP("Fairness to Fiduciaries: The omission firewall, verbatim evidence mandate, and explicit characterization of findings as machine-generated audit assessments -- not judicial decrees -- prevent unfair accusations. The evaluation corpus was limited to publicly accessible published privacy policies.")
